B = [
 ('MG', 'Europe', '1930s and 1960s', 'cars', 'In the style of MG, small, jaunty, open-air sporting spirit. Upright, narrow proportions with a tall formal face of fine vertical lines, a long flat top plane, cut-away edges and separate sweeping curves ending in a rounded close. Racing green, red, cream, ivory and pale blue, set against polished chrome. Red or black leather, engine-turned metal and warm wood grain add craft. Round, chrome-rimmed forms and fine radiating line patterns give period charm. Spirited, cheerful, plucky and simple.'),
 ('Jeep', 'North America', '1940s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Jeep, rugged, utilitarian, honest, military-derived adventure design. Flat, boxy slabs with upright vertical rhythms flanked by round forms, squared-off curves, short overhangs and a stripped-back stance. Olive drab, sand, desert tan, safety yellow and bright orange. Exposed bolts and fixings, heavy black matte edging, chunky knobby textures and bare painted metal with simple grab-able shapes. Soft canvas contrasts with hard flat panels. Hose-down simplicity, function first, with nothing decorative.'),
 ('Plymouth', 'North America', '1957-1970', 'cars', 'In the style of Plymouth, bold and cheeky American design from the late 1950s through the 1960s. Wide, flat, low proportions with long sculpted sides, a sweeping two-tone contrast line and bright chrome bars running the full width. Sharp, tall, blade-like projections slanting backward give a jet-age thrust, while loud graphic decals and a cartoon character add cheek. Saturated purple, vivid orange, lemon yellow and bright green against shiny metal. Confident, playful, exaggerated and optimistic, with a love of speed and showmanship.'),
 ('Honda', 'East Asia', '1990s-2000s', 'cars', 'In the style of Honda, precise, light and clever Japanese engineering of the 1990s and 2000s. Low, sleek, compact forms with thin swept-back wedge details, generous transparency and tidy rounded shapes ending in a cut-off squared edge. Sporty accents use red marks, raised blade shapes and bright metal star-like motifs. Clear white-on-black graphics, snug proportions and short, neat details, with a single small letter mark. Championship white, bright red, sunny yellow, black and silver. Eager, tidy and efficient.'),
 ('Gurgel', 'Latin America', '1970s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Gurgel, small, toylike, rugged, home-made Brazilian utility spirit. Boxy upright shapes with flat faces, a high squared mass and big rounded arches. Round forms sit in plain recessed fields with simple slot-like openings, black edging and small steel shapes. Bare fibreglass-like surfaces, flat planes and solid, shiny gel-coated colour. Palette of bright orange, lime green, bright yellow and sky blue. Cheerful, rugged, inventive and proudly improvised, as if built in a workshop for fun.'),
 ('Hermes', 'Europe', '1920s-present', 'leather goods', 'In the style of Hermes, hand-crafted luxury with visible, slightly slanted double-thread saddle stitching along crisp edges, in smooth calf, pebbled grain or fine textured leather. Saturated orange, golden tan, black, deep red and deep blue. Structured trapezoid forms, slim straps and small turn-lock shapes in palladium or gold-plated metal. Silk twill with hand-rolled edges, printed with riding and floral scenes in dense multicolour borders. Warm orange with brown accents. Discreet, minimal marks, exquisite craft and quiet wealth.'),
 ('Barbour', 'Europe', '1900s-present', 'outerwear', 'In the style of Barbour, rural, practical, weathered British field character. A waxed, slightly sticky, matte and oily surface in dark olive green, navy and tan that creases and fades along the folds. Dark brown corduroy contrast, tartan wool in warm checks, heavy brass metal, leather accents and rugged double-needle stitching. Diamond-quilted textures with ribbed edges. Any mark stays small and woven, never loud. Hunting, fishing and countryside heritage, well worn, repaired and handed down.'),
 ('Patagonia', 'North America', '1980s-present', 'outdoor', 'In the style of Patagonia, technical outdoor honesty. Fuzzy, soft, tactile pile texture in colour-blocked panels of teal, red, mustard, navy and purple, set against smooth nylon-like sheen. Short, baggy, practical shapes. A small rectangular mark of a jagged mountain skyline above a sunset gradient. Recycled materials, muted but vivid earthy hues and bold blocks of colour. Functional and minimal, with a climbing and surf culture spirit. Rugged, caring and unpolished.'),
 ('Carhartt', 'North America', '1900s-present', 'workwear', 'In the style of Carhartt, rugged American labourer character built on heavy duck canvas in tobacco brown, black and faded tan. Triple-stitched seams, riveted stress points, quilted flannel and corduroy contrast, with generous, boxy, hard-working proportions and folded, doubled-up reinforcement. A small square mark in red and white or brown. Stiff, dense cotton that softens, fades and scuffs with wear. Honest, durable, sturdy and unfussy, built to last a lifetime of hard work.'),
 ('Vivienne Westwood', 'Europe', '1970s-present', 'fashion', 'In the style of Vivienne Westwood, theatrical, rebellious and romantic punk meets historical costume. Tartan in red and black, buckled straps and zips, safety pins, corseted waists and bustier shapes, ruffled pirate volumes, hooped skirt structures, high platform volumes and draped asymmetrical jersey. An orb motif of a ringed globe with a cross in gold or silver, pearls, gold sequins and pink and green accents. Torn, slashed and layered. Irreverent, scholarly and sensual.'),
 ('Adidas', 'Europe', '1970s-present', 'sportswear', 'In the style of Adidas, clean, sporty, street-ready athletic energy. Three parallel diagonal stripes as the core motif, with a trefoil mark of three leaves on a base. White with contrasting stripes in black, green or red, and shiny sheen in blue, red, black and white. Retro 1970s terry textures, bold colour blocks and warm gum-coloured accents. Heritage, confident, casual and playful, with a crisp terrace and track-side attitude.'),
 ('Puma', 'Europe', '1960s-80s', 'sportswear', 'In the style of Puma, sleek, cool, sporty swagger of the 1970s and 80s. A curved swoosh-like band sweeping along the side, a leaping cat silhouette mark, soft suede in dark green, blue, red and black with a single white stripe. Velour with piped trim and ribbed edges, retro football shapes and colour blocking. Low, lean silhouettes, glossy and matte contrasts, and a confident athletic attitude.'),
 ('Fjallraven', 'Europe', '1960s-present', 'outdoor', 'In the style of Fjallraven, rugged, minimal, sensible Scandinavian northern forest feel. A small stylised arctic fox head mark in orange and white. Rectangular forms in dense waxed texture in khaki, forest green, navy, dark grey and mustard yellow. Simple flat faces, straight-cut shapes, bold colour-block panels and reinforced patches. Plain, practical and long-lasting, with a calm outdoor sensibility and nothing superfluous.'),
 ('Hunter', 'Europe', '1950s-present', 'footwear', 'In the style of Hunter, smooth, glossy, waterproof rubber look with a slight sheen in deep green, navy, black or bright seasonal colours. Rounded forms, a small red tab mark, textured matte moulded seams and a thick, chunky grip pattern. Sturdy, practical, weatherproof shapes with simple clean lines and a polished, wipe-clean surface. British countryside and festival mood, muddy and cheerful.'),
 ('Swanndri', 'Oceania', '1910s-present', 'fashion', 'In the style of Swanndri, heavy felted wool cloth in bold large checks and plaids, such as red and black, blue and black, green and black, mustard and navy. Boxy, long, generous shapes with a utilitarian cut and reinforced stress points. The surface is dense, slightly fuzzy and water-resistant, with sturdy stitching and metal eyelets. Rugged farm and hunting mood, with misty green hills, sheep country and muddy tracks.'),
 ('Ercol', 'Europe', '1950s', 'furniture', 'In the style of Ercol, English post-war design in pale elm and beech. Slender spindles, sweeping hoops, curved arms, splayed tapering legs and simple bentwood construction. Light blond finishes and darker stained elm with visible swirling grain, round-cornered boxes with tapered feet and a gentle radiating rhythm. Warm rust, olive and mustard tweed tones. Warm, domestic and gentle, with a suburban 1950s feel.'),
 ('Marvel Silver Age', 'North America', '1960s', 'comics', 'In the style of Marvel Silver Age, dynamic, muscular heroes with dramatic foreshortening, bold black ink with heavy shadows and halftone dots in four-colour print. Primary red, blue and yellow with purple and green accents. Fists bursting out of the frame, cosmic energy crackles, cheerful yellow boxes of text, bold all-caps hand-lettering with exclamation points, jagged starburst effects and a mighty boxed lettering style. Exuberant, heroic and larger than life.'),
 ('Columbia Sportswear', 'North America', '1980s-90s', 'outdoor', 'In the style of Columbia Sportswear, practical, layered, weather-ready design with puffy volumes in bold colour-block panels of red, bright blue, yellow, forest green and black, with contrasting broad shoulder and arm zones. Khaki and sage utility tones with many small functional details. A mark of a stylised mountain peak with a capital C embedded, with a bold block wordmark. Sturdy ripstop textures, quilted waterproof surfaces and silver dotted reflective accents. Rainy Pacific Northwest and chunky ski-lodge fashion from the 1990s.'),
 ('Deutsche Bahn', 'Europe', '1990s-present', 'transport', 'In the style of Deutsche Bahn, clean, efficient, clinical modern public design with white bodies, a bright red stripe along the lower edge and light grey bands. A logo of two red rounded slanted bars forming a stylised track, in a white rectangle with a red outline. Aerodynamic pointed forms, smooth tapered openings and sharp clean lines. Lettering in white sans-serif capitals on dark grey or red fields, tidy pictograms and neat grid layouts, with yellow information fields. Functionalist, orderly and precise, with polished grey surfaces and glass.'),
 ('Evinrude outboards', 'North America', '1950s-60s', 'marine', 'In the style of Evinrude outboards, smooth, rounded, streamlined forms in two-tone pastel enamel of powder blue, seafoam green, cream or white with a bright accent stripe. Chrome plated trim and bolts, gleaming stainless parts and fin-like jet-age shapes. Raised capital letters, chrome script text and a stylised horse-shaped mark. Clean shine on every surface, with a cheerful, optimistic 1950s American lake-holiday mood and a tidy, gleaming, freshly waxed finish.'),
 ('Alpha Industries', 'North America', '1950s-present', 'military', 'In the style of Alpha Industries, military-issue flight design with a short, blousy cut, glossy nylon sheen in sage green, black, navy or midnight blue, and bright international orange as a hidden contrast. Ribbed knit edges, heavy metal hardware, small sew-on tabs and subdued woven patches. Soft puffy quilting, lightweight, slightly crinkled finish. Surplus-store feel, stencilled lettering in a utilitarian military face, cold-war aviation heritage, practical and cool.'),
 ('Coleman', 'North America', '1940s-60s', 'outdoor', 'In the style of Coleman, vintage camping character in a distinctive olive green or sage baked enamel finish with cream or tan trim, glass, brass knobs and wire loop details. Rounded steel shapes, chrome accents and steel volumes with swing-style curves. Red and white script lettering on a small plate, a worn painted metal look with some rust and dents, and khaki canvas. Postwar American family camping, nostalgic, sturdy, with rounded edges and a campfire glow.'),
 ('Tabasco', 'North America', '1900s-present', 'food', 'In the style of Tabasco, slim, tiny, hand-finished heritage with narrow proportions, a long neck, flat shoulder and small rounded base. Vivid fire-engine red-orange glows through clear glass, accented in green. Layers combine a deep green oval band and a red diamond centre with white serif capitals and a thin gold border. Accent colours vary to signal variants. Palette is fiery red, forest green, cream and gold. Mood is spicy, Southern, authentic and compact, with a diamond emblem on a slender frame.'),
 ('KitchenAid', 'North America', '1930s-present', 'appliances', 'In the style of KitchenAid, sturdy, generous, homey with a vintage curve. Heavy cast metal bodies with smooth bulbous curved tops and tall flat-bottomed steel or glass shapes with curved handles. Glossy enamel in empire red, onyx black, white, pistachio, pastel blue and cream, with polished chrome accents and a round hub motif. Brushed silver secondary parts and stainless script lettering. Friendly, solid, kitchen-counter pride.'),
 ('Triumph Motorcycles', 'Europe', '1960s', 'motorcycles', 'In the style of Triumph Motorcycles, nostalgic British cafe-racer attitude. Compact, lean, forward-leaning proportions with small tapered volumes and a short, tight stance. Polished metal and chrome set against bright enamel colour such as silver, blaze yellow, red and pastel blue, with thin white pinstripes and a small neat enamel badge. Round, simple forms, ribbed black upholstery and fine mechanical detail left visible. Honest, hand-built, a little rebellious.'),
 ('Ducati', 'Europe', '1990s-present', 'motorcycles', 'In the style of Ducati, fast, sculpted, muscular racing-bred Italian intensity. Glossy Italian red with white or black accents, exposed structure in red, visible fins, sharply tapered forms with aggressive paired lights and a bold racing stripe. Gold or black radiating circles and drilled details. Muscular, stacked and mechanical. Mood is intense, athletic and passionate, with red dominating and every shape pulled tight over the structure.'),
 ('Royal Enfield', 'South Asia', '1950s-present', 'motorcycles', 'In the style of Royal Enfield, honest, rugged vintage British-Indian character. Rounded, heavy build with deep teardrop volumes in gloss black, deep green, maroon or cream with pinstripes and a circular badge with a cannon emblem. Upright round chrome forms, polished alloy, upright lines and tan or black leather. Big sweeping curved panels and fine wire-like detailing. Hardy, unhurried and proudly old-fashioned.'),
 ('BSA', 'Europe', '1950s-60s', 'motorcycles', 'In the style of BSA, solid, utilitarian British classic. Sturdy profile, bright finishes in polished chrome and cherry red, black or sunshine yellow, with a badge of three rifles in a circle. Rounded volumes with chrome panels, valanced curves and bulky silver forms. Upright lines, wire-like details and ribbed textures. Honest, hardy and plain-spoken, with bright metal against solid colour and a practical, no-nonsense post-war workmanlike mood.'),
 ('Fendt', 'Europe', '2000s-present', 'tractors', 'In the style of Fendt, premium, precise German engineering in glossy, bright lime green with matte black accents. High-polish paint, sleek rounded lines and sharply cut angular strips of light. Large glass areas with curved panoramic sweep, metallic silver and black faces, and minimal clutter across clean, tight surfaces. Exact gaps between panels suggest sharp machining. Modern, upmarket, tidy, high-tech and confident, like agricultural luxury.'),
 ('Orient Express', 'Europe', '1920s-30s', 'railways', 'In the style of Orient Express, opulent, romantic 1920s-30s luxury travel. Deep royal blue panels with gold lettering and fine gold lining, rounded barrel-vaulted forms and polished brass. Glossy varnished teak and mahogany, marquetry panels, burgundy velvet, crisp white linen, crystal and silver. Art deco lamps have frosted glass tulip shades. Everything is lacquered, gilded and carefully made. Atmosphere is glamorous, intimate, mysterious and unhurried.'),
 ('Pullman', 'North America', '1900s-30s', 'railways', 'In the style of Pullman, formal Gilded Age elegance in luxury travel of the early 1900s. Deep dark green paint with elaborate gold-leaf lettering and lines, arched forms, small high openings and open railings. Walnut with green or burgundy plush upholstery, brass fittings and gaslight-style lamps. Heavy, solid, stately forms. Ornate, rich, ceremonial, hand-gilded and imposing, like a rolling grand hotel.'),
 ('Flying Pigeon', 'East Asia', '1960s-1980s', 'vehicles', 'In the style of Flying Pigeon, utilitarian, durable, plain, communal and nostalgic mid-century Chinese design. Black enamelled steel with strong diamond-shaped geometry, thin lines against large round forms, chrome rims and curved edges ending in pale cream tips. Wide upright sweeping curves with black grips. White pinstripes and gold-lined transfers, a stylised dove head badge, and thick cream-walled or black rubber. Muted monochrome palette of black, chrome and cream, seen in long dense rows.'),
 ('Cathay Pacific', 'East Asia', '1970s-2010s', 'airlines', 'In the style of Cathay Pacific, calm, urbane, polished, glassy and well-travelled design in green and white. A clean white ground with a thin jade green line, dark green accents and a calligraphic brush-stroke emblem like a swept bird wing curving upward in white or pale green. An earlier version used lettuce green and white two-tone. Upright dark green sans-serif lettering with small simple Chinese script beside it. Quiet warm timber-toned panels, bottle green with pale covers, soft cream leather and thin gold accents. Harbour skyline at dusk.'),
 ('Star Ferry', 'East Asia', '1950s-present', 'transport', 'In the style of Star Ferry, leisurely, nostalgic, salty and civic harbour charm. Low, broad forms with rounded overhanging fronts, a white upper level and thin white railing. Deep bottle green below clean white, with a gold rubbing line, black cap, brass fittings and cream rings. Names in white Latin letters and Chinese characters. Creamy paint, varnished timber and round porthole shapes. Skyscrapers behind, hazy sky and dark teal water.'),
 ('Sarao Motors', 'Southeast Asia', '1950s-1970s', 'vehicles', 'In the style of Sarao Motors, exuberant, crowded, festive, handmade design. Long boxy hand-beaten metal forms with a long front volume and a canopy roof. Every surface is covered in loud hand painted patterns such as stripes, checks, flames, flowers and animals, outlined in chrome strips, with abundant chrome decoration, small metal figures, tassels and many mirrors. Bold painted lettering carries slogans and names, with religious pictures set above. Polished rails, velvet or vinyl, fringes and mirrors. Saturated colour and heaps of chrome shining in the sun.'),
 ('Philippine Airlines', 'Southeast Asia', '1990s-present', 'airlines', 'In the style of Philippine Airlines, bright, hospitable, tropical, crisp and patriotic identity built from sail-like triangles. Clean white grounds with italic blue capitals, and a device of one blue triangle and one red triangle pointing like sails, with a small eight rayed yellow sun over the blue. A thin red and blue stripe adds rhythm. Deep blue with red piping and woven patterns, soft light and warm timber. Blue, red, white and sunny yellow.'),
 ('Iran Khodro', 'Middle East', '1970s-1990s', 'cars', 'In the style of Iran Khodro, humble, durable, nostalgic, lived-in practical mid-century design. Plain upright boxy forms with flat tops, small rectangular faces with a single horizontal bar, round or square chrome rimmed shapes and thin chrome edging. Paint is thick solid enamel in cream white, sky blue, pale yellow, red, green or bright orange, slightly faded, with black rubber edging. Flat plain beige or brown vinyl surfaces. Seen in rows in dusty light below mountains. Communal and unfussy.'),
 ('Ararat Brandy', 'Middle East', '1900s-present', 'drinks', 'In the style of Ararat Brandy, deep, aged, ceremonial and warm amber heritage design. Heavy, rounded-shouldered forms with a deep amber glow, dark cork or gilded accents. Cream or ivory paper tones with a gold embossed border, a tall mountain with a snowy twin peak, strong serif capitals, an age numeral in a gold seal and a small vignette of a stone building. A red phoenix emblem appears on newer versions. Rows of little gold stars signal quality. Rich brown, gold, burgundy and cream.'),
 ('Granado Pharmacias', 'Latin America', '1870s-present', 'cosmetics', 'In the style of Granado Pharmacias, nostalgic, refined, slightly aristocratic nineteenth-century apothecary design. Simple old-fashioned materials such as glass, cork, frosted surfaces, tin and plain paper. Cream, white, pale pink or soft green grounds with a thin double-line border, centred oval cartouches, fine ornamental scrollwork and curling flourishes, with elegant serif and decorative Victorian display lettering in deep burgundy, bottle green, navy or gold. Tiny repeating floral and botanical prints and sometimes a small crowned crest. Dark polished wood, marble and tiled black and white or terracotta. Muted pastel and old-gold accents with restrained, tidy typography.'),
 ('Havanna Alfajores', 'Latin America', '1940s-present', 'confectionery', 'In the style of Havanna Alfajores, friendly, sweet, nostalgic seaside design in a trustworthy clean cream and blue palette. Deep turquoise-blue or royal blue and white schemes with warm cream, a large rounded white script mark like a flowing signature over navy, slim gold or silver details and a small orange rising-sun mark. Soft rounded rectangular shapes, shiny foil, tin and maritime references such as a seaside town and small gulls. Round, glossy dark chocolate or white icing over soft pale layers. Warm wood-and-brass spaces, with dark wood, tall windows, beige marble and lamps with amber light.'),
]
